
Acey Ducey
----------

There are no docs for this door, just set it up as normal.

This is an Acey Ducey door by Mark D Turner in HiSoftBasic.

Acey Ducey is a gambling game where two cards are dealt, and you bet on
the result that the third card dealt will be BETWEEN the two others.

You get fifteen goes and your score carries through.  After the fifteen
goes, you have a chance to make the high scores table.

From the exe, I gleaned this text:

This program was written by Mark D.  Turner.

This program is also Next-To-Nothing-Ware!  What does this mean??

If you enjoy this program, then why not send 25 cents or so to:

